#: scenario4:scenario4_3A3AB18D_914F_4D7D_A8F8_47F3C26A1973
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d2c7e42c955b29bd8bbe88c650267b835248e551985e661aeda079128f833d22
#. default-sha256: cdd6fbad5a417df1926c5a62629e0e7967b1384d61e7138fbc1f7550a296a3c8
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_3A3AB18D_914F_4D7D_A8F8_47F3C26A1973"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It had been about a week since the White-Haired Girl had taken up residence in the mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫소녀가 저택에 온 지 ⟪k:1⟫약 일주일 정도가 지났습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_CA14D481_F927_4BC4_9958_89127B00B8B1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9c6010519692e9f115cb381e8e92f7788534a6588d93cd54258e7fab63171247
#. default-sha256: 0bd1dc56e5c87d1e3521f601b4e0c7e3f96bb536ecd81204efaf97c2c3ed7dcf
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_CA14D481_F927_4BC4_9958_89127B00B8B1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Staying in that house deprived of light was, I imagine, a very claustrophobic experience."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫캄캄한 저택 생활은 ⟪k:1⟫폐쇄감이 가득했을 겁니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_A191B3E2_744B_40E6_BC31_09F8B9BC8D69
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 691541f0c4547b031bf2451cc7830b24b9ca64485ed4770a084d2d2ede64a1c2
#. default-sha256: 49fc7b971266ebb9c3c853d48528b3992e700bcbbb4ee29269babe4c18e830d2
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A191B3E2_744B_40E6_BC31_09F8B9BC8D69"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫To anyone blessed enough to have sunlight as a part of their everyday lives, it would have "
"been unbearable."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫햇살 아래에서 사는 것을 당연히 여기는 ⟪k:1⟫평화로운 분들이라면…… 도저히 못 살 환경이었겠지요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_FAFA92C5_1D4E_459F_9D64_B65AFCC317F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e406daa626996d1dd3d63440bf21cef000befc4d2a5134f209d45a02c0df29fa
#. default-sha256: 2e9b9b4d415983ba6a1ba8a3a291ddc27baf5fa3f9566f0df6de9a9780380c6f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_FAFA92C5_1D4E_459F_9D64_B65AFCC317F0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But for her, the mansion—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫with its prison walls and lack of either illumination or "
"recreation—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만 소녀에게는 ⟪k:1⟫오락거리와 빛이 없는 ⟪k:2⟫감옥 같은 저택도――"

#: scenario4:scenario4_9D4BEBF1_80AA_4E52_98BB_1FEF04B35971
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e172641e3767d2e4430b694d3ef877b663366c8bef7ca4e19e45ca1d9038530c
#. default-sha256: 9b99081f5fd36333757d9b319ef37aa28b9c19cc24a5dc0c13d07bfcf20e7515
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_9D4BEBF1_80AA_4E52_98BB_1FEF04B35971"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫was the one place she could find respite."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫안식처처럼 느껴졌습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_2C19D17D_1B86_464E_BD1A_5D58985CF708
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c165ef2f452b2fee03de59d662a0da3502e0c519305aaad0d660d9f74a63fa44
#. default-sha256: 4a5f5c7315ff00194beb9361077f01b0680fec54767f33f46771d47e91c76c22
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_2C19D17D_1B86_464E_BD1A_5D58985CF708"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She and Michel continued to be distant, however."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫자, ⟪k:1⟫이 둘의 관계는 ⟪k:2⟫아니나 다를까, ⟪k:3⟫여전히 벽이 느껴졌습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_41A0DF7B_FEF0_4138_9D23_61C4F5FABF7B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 852d826d3af26d4ae6d69dae98d7a0ab3e09fc9ea5b3422b9e5d8072e7a1a952
#. default-sha256: 2004f583a7f087afa5c6ad21385a561cf7bbc7a3dda50083de92bd209ed1bf86
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_41A0DF7B_FEF0_4138_9D23_61C4F5FABF7B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He spent most of his time in his chambers, which he had explicitly told the White-Haired "
"Girl to stay out of, leaving her unable to close that gap."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫미셸은 거의 본인 방에서만 지냈는데, ⟪k:1⟫방에 들어오지 말라 한 이상은 ⟪k:2⟫백발 소녀도 함부"
"로 들어갈 수 없었답니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_419AA7BE_CF8A_47D9_B354_FE57A702C379
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ad6d3689914230a9bcc5360f7754d46604b848656c959a18011e7c49f71fd976
#. default-sha256: 0c324b5ed868c5482cffab70d70bd874ce3f3ab0d52b630b33ea08438931ecb2
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_419AA7BE_CF8A_47D9_B354_FE57A702C379"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nonetheless, on the occasions they did cross paths in the hallway,⟪k:1⟫their eyes would meet—"
"⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫if but briefly."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만 ⟪k:1⟫어쩌다 마주치면 ⟪k:2⟫둘의 시선이 잠시 마주 보곤 했습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_BA131BFB_3883_4E0E_AA4B_FCA79D169316
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1661dc168c3888783a49da3f8a27af28f3974f60830539f39253a71123ac0307
#. default-sha256: e81729ba2e54b7e51084c84008056f1bb5d77ac4bd79befb2776254fda1c992d
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_BA131BFB_3883_4E0E_AA4B_FCA79D169316"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was never for more than a few seconds.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Whenever she saw him, she made a point of "
"giving him a little smile."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그건 ⟪k:1⟫단 몇 초에 불과했습니다. ⟪k:2⟫백발 소녀는 ⟪k:3⟫미셸을 보면 반드시 수줍게 미소 지었"
"습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_E589D0D3_9447_4659_B771_8331DEB129FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 58765c6eafdff1153ab39bc4b4bd61d94cc896f586a45d0bab3f43e06f255763
#. default-sha256: df025a0cb5091eb6ddb0167da858fafed773a031a8474ab45ed60f4b96fcc808
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E589D0D3_9447_4659_B771_8331DEB129FD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He never said anything, but still, when she had first arrived, he would not have even met "
"her gaze."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫미셸은 아무 말도 안 했지만, ⟪k:1⟫첫날 같았으면 눈길도 주지 않았을 겁니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_47AC4865_F13E_483C_B557_9E8D0D9C0774
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 55acf2d03e54b3a1b4fa2db5b7dec2ca44c89045a1902bd819c3ee354d9d93e5
#. default-sha256: a65a0f0df12f5b0c11fb04f8eec028070ae577c3553810d8999cf89c9a706e1d
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_47AC4865_F13E_483C_B557_9E8D0D9C0774"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He seemed to be taking more and more notice of her."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫미셸도 ⟪k:1⟫소녀의 존재를 의식하기 시작하는…… 분위기였지요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_9050C588_7A68_4FEA_8488_372AA36F7653
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8de05bd8279b775f2953acf2297daef36162b02eebd5306178123735767509d3
#. default-sha256: 8abdfa0b83f992faa2dadd6668e78161d28b799e88f752c37ca700fca62a32a5
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_9050C588_7A68_4FEA_8488_372AA36F7653"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫One day, the White-Haired Girl stood in the cellar, a frown on her face."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그러던 어느 날, ⟪k:2⟫소녀는 창고에서 난처한 표정을 짓고 있었습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_1FAD219B_A05E_47E3_9C94_1A264074123E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ad42a6666ec0d1ac0e1734acea874c4c8715ff0abd3f6de12ac36bdf5df7d257
#. default-sha256: 321b1f9e672dc5895731cb6872d27d181d6ad9271842b62584e16ae9d17c12c9
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_1FAD219B_A05E_47E3_9C94_1A264074123E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(Well, this is troubling...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I can’t go down to the village...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫but if we "
"don’t do something soon...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(어떡하지…….⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ 마을로 갈 수도 없는 노릇인데. ⟪k:3⟫하지만 ⟪k:4⟫이대로 가다간……)"

#: scenario4:scenario4_C7C31BBE_4520_4B03_895C_9A9E2E31B043
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c00d2646793359e5a0dc9b5f0b9ce524254c5cb9875aa4abefbf8152ccbfcc6d
#. default-sha256: 31b54adc12e8b28c98d65600e59c1d439b16301d3d9228e49b6b12fab27675af
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_C7C31BBE_4520_4B03_895C_9A9E2E31B043"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………."

#: scenario4:scenario4_6772CFC4_884E_4AA8_BC06_143BC8034363
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0f466fc3687be52b058aff8b67267522a0f8d5e42dafc1d654fd22cf64ed37dd
#. default-sha256: 1cbf73dc75cd458b689140edfa8fadf33a179a612790579d2907be2272f6ac08
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6772CFC4_884E_4AA8_BC06_143BC8034363"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The cellar was where their food was stored—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫an assortment of nonperishables and "
"dried foods, smoked meats and cheeses."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그곳은 식량이 보존되는 창고였습니다. ⟪k:1⟫보존된 건 오래 가는 건조식품, ⟪k:2⟫훈제, 치즈 등."

#: scenario4:scenario4_7DF38F10_3DF3_45C1_9032_8EFC0EB9C983
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2fb9b0e05849d40e037e0656e13cd16eb981002689634ec455364480f647e062
#. default-sha256: 299eb40d9a3c4368af66be3ce3ad8016ae66a9aa36091da7f5a7d7ca6d8892e3
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7DF38F10_3DF3_45C1_9032_8EFC0EB9C983"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her daily meals were taken from the supplies there. ⟪k:1⟫However, the stockpile was "
"beginning to grow quite small."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫매 끼니는 ⟪k:1⟫창고의 비축분으로 해결했습니다. ⟪k:2⟫하지만 저택 생활이 길어지면서 ⟪k:3⟫비축"
"이 바닥을 치려 했지요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_9D1FF1CA_1B11_4CEC_884A_BED48D6AC2ED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0d27a1ee25c484bc3fab26d13c4995ff19d2b95e0171cb647752ef412e887ef2
#. default-sha256: 24287388421c52a47df8c47c82f3ddc2bedcdc499d0a01d20d2b317172021b99
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_9D1FF1CA_1B11_4CEC_884A_BED48D6AC2ED"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Were she not on the run, she could have gone to the village to procure more."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫소녀가 쫓기는 몸이 아니었다면 ⟪k:1⟫마을로 가서 식재료를 얻을 수 있었을 겁니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_2E697E6F_E846_4699_A77B_01ABD9A7FE97
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d65536308b8907b0f8e5b3694f9e5f81ad07bf331e3412bf1d0efe5466f256c8
#. default-sha256: a8abaf6605a36c1d55e25e1f1977d7f50d3d7b50adef7140eabd4ca8bf5534a3
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_2E697E6F_E846_4699_A77B_01ABD9A7FE97"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Or perhaps, were she a little tougher, she could have captured a wild animal for its meat."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫혹은 소녀가 힘이 셌다면 ⟪k:1⟫야생동물을 잡을 수도 있었겠군요?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_AD7A4BAA_BA3E_43B8_9766_C2C60BF2E6DB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ce32d12521f44450168a804012dace2c0a81f188c81d06f5b53a022d0bee0699
#. default-sha256: f741f58decc8099342cc6f812894f9ea4c9ba61eb24380c45f7591975585c2c8
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_AD7A4BAA_BA3E_43B8_9766_C2C60BF2E6DB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Hehe... ⟪k:1⟫But Master, you know a young, delicate thing like her was hardly up to the task "
"of hunting for food."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫후후…… 하지만 주인님. ⟪k:1⟫소녀처럼 가련한 아이가 ⟪k:2⟫그게 가능할 리 없단 건 보면 아시겠지"
"요?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_058A15FB_40C9_4C42_B7C6_7467071F65FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 13ce7358c628207026b5339b37711ccee1e342e895d46c79aacb844efaa09843
#. default-sha256: 5f20c36ce7f3c12ab5c086b1fc8ba187d9c19bb559424a134d0c6c167231e8f2
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_058A15FB_40C9_4C42_B7C6_7467071F65FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫How does he normally get his supplies, I wonder?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……그 분은 ⟪k:1⟫이럴 때 어떡하시는 걸까……."

#: scenario4:scenario4_0F8AAD60_039D_4743_90BB_E791E77745CE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6710b4e124cd4be966a82c0f9826493dd77296799325bbc8d8de637004683de4
#. default-sha256: 23a07a49e743fbd71b00a4df7d451cac0a6c0941fb17a3eb874e1b9fe2ae77ac
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_0F8AAD60_039D_4743_90BB_E791E77745CE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫From there, other questions about Michel started rising in her mind. ⟪k:1⟫No matter how "
"lifeless he seemed..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그때 소녀는 미셸에게 ⟪k:1⟫의문을 느꼈습니다. ⟪k:2⟫설마 ⟪k:3⟫아무리 산 자 같은 분위기가 안 나"
"는 청년이라지만――"

#: scenario4:scenario4_87865C14_5F55_44EC_942E_30D9AA895D4C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ede3e3a4fa48fe66a57e775719716d2935da7731b3237ec2b6c6c5f9c2dad830
#. default-sha256: 74db24d890e50e66543a4d1310d2acf5bb2ff6a603a1f5211d29f2a5cd394e70
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_87865C14_5F55_44EC_942E_30D9AA895D4C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫surely⟪k:2⟫ he still had to eat, right?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫식사를 안 할 리는 없을 테니까요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_C7D68F39_01B3_452B_97D1_6070B28AC292
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 14de9a753d957019227545bf2b5f8acf971c20153b61f112c4052ceac293f459
#. default-sha256: 11bd31290ead7220e3e594328b4e639181e708bda86c9e80f8b24b5bf6f05336
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_C7D68F39_01B3_452B_97D1_6070B28AC292"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl nodded, then made her way out of the cellar, intending to head for his "
"bedchamber."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫소녀는 고개를 살짝 끄덕이곤 ⟪k:1⟫창고에서 나왔습니다. ⟪k:2⟫그리고 ⟪k:3⟫미셸의 방으로 가려 했"
"지요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_4D147211_E99D_42C2_B81C_D7CE886146E1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 64b7ffab5cba3376adb676062f1803d5e971275f6cfc097226a338eb0ccf3f7d
#. default-sha256: 1791021f3b8c7334b572067221ff7b4fc65ddb1bfec1bad05e8e9a66675301e3
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_4D147211_E99D_42C2_B81C_D7CE886146E1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ah..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……아……."

#: scenario4:scenario4_3B0F559A_0143_4023_936D_B8594593E90A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e5691985f44120d96e2c8f50ae990ee96f5da5a197f8a3af41d3eb911511e41d
#. default-sha256: 273ffefe16d3730c92d22d152cdeb14676d63513b2887af6ff1863dde980fe4d
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_3B0F559A_0143_4023_936D_B8594593E90A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But on her way there, she spotted him standing by the entrance,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만 ⟪k:1⟫미셸의 방까지 갈 것도 없이, ⟪k:2⟫현관에서 미셸을 발견했습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_E0603546_E5DC_49EA_85A5_308CDFAB747B
