msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The White-Haired Girl turned toward Michel to press him for more information, but "
"he averted his gaze."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫백발 소녀는 ⟪k:3⟫미셸에게 대답을 바라는 시선을 보냈으나, ⟪k:4⟫미셸은 시선을 홱 돌렸"
"습니다."

