#: scenario4:scenario4_BBCC5ABA_4508_42BE_9184_261D959B28C3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6b873ec12e529443d454462b43e501a96102b3563e34868924790750b5815cd6
