msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The sunlight—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫which she had not seen in some time—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫was so bright it seemed "
"to burn her eyes."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫오랜만에 보는 바깥 빛은 ⟪k:1⟫소녀의 눈을 유독 세게 자극했습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_EBBBBC96_08D4_4E6A_81C7_FE950D58835E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 06cc1e38e0cafd377bbd372108a69e655256ac786e2b4ec9e4c9c6e5478396af
