msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_EBBBBC96_08D4_4E6A_81C7_FE950D58835E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Although the sun itself had not gotten any brighter—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫she had simply spent so much "
"time in the dark her eyes were no longer accustomed to that much light."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……아니군요, ⟪k:1⟫사실 햇살이 세지진 않았을 겁니다. ⟪k:2⟫캄캄한 저택에서 오래 지냈기에 ⟪k:3⟫햇"
"빛이 ⟪k:4⟫익숙질 않아진 것이지요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_1743A20C_19DF_476A_BE0E_CF317A931797
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 379c4e61d91962b3c2a8ce402f45a2599740a3d17f51c2887b4a4446d276d16b
#. default-sha256: eadad80d46aa141bf13c0fb7458ff10fd51aa93900c1dbd75e976801d7a55ca4
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_1743A20C_19DF_476A_BE0E_CF317A931797"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The color of her eyes made them quite sensitive to light already, so when she stepped "
"outside, her whole world went bone white."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫소녀 앞에 깔린 새하얀 세계. ⟪k:1⟫심지어 ⟪k:2⟫색소가 옅은 소녀의 눈은 ⟪k:3⟫빛에 약합니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_C2786865_DC4D_41E8_BA59_715BA2D60274
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c7b567fece7ce5c3cf3a74c956f679e210f3bf3f570b1eeb3de6f3d4d7ca5525
