msgstr "⟪k:0⟫발밑에 ⟪k:1⟫한 나무상자가 놓인 게 보였습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_E18C489C_F90A_45D4_A4F9_5E1E586BC899
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 008200ad062a53d0a00982c913e3ea09d128b95fc91a04a082cfddf5c71678ab
