msgid "⟪k:0⟫From where she stood, she was unable to distinguish Michel from the shadows."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫소녀가 선 위치에선 ⟪k:1⟫미셸의 모습이 ⟪k:2⟫어둠에 녹아들어 보이지 않았습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_54251AF9_3BA8_4E58_A34A_F13A62645D3F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8db3861e40af3fde4a26758383893f986257a5ad8f3ebc2c001d0d0c2907d58b
