msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A pang of nervousness struck her; ⟪k:1⟫she wanted to return to that darkness as quickly as "
"possible."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫소녀는 조금 ⟪k:1⟫불안해졌습니다. ⟪k:2⟫그리고 ⟪k:3⟫빨리 캄캄한 세계로 ⟪k:4⟫돌아가고 싶어졌습니"
"다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_3D73C680_7370_4AE8_B1E0_CE4E6095C60F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: be25af55b8202d29ef072719e07b378d2a0fcce8367b40531c21d039b65f6c9d
