msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl had come to yearn for that world without light more than the one with."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫밝은 햇살 밑 세계가 아니라, ⟪k:1⟫빛이라곤 어디에도 없는 어둠이――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫소녀가 바라는 세계"
"가 되어 있었습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_E1152686_7214_4F5E_82C2_746A5CD16163
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a8637179b4c5335aee099d96fc04fcf4a12d4a7b015557d17466eb081e2d30dd
