msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The crate was fairly hefty; ⟪k:1⟫the slightly built girl had considerable difficulty "
"bringing it into the house."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫나무상자는 ⟪k:1⟫무게가 좀 나갔습니다. ⟪k:2⟫그래서 ⟪k:3⟫몸집도 작은 소녀 혼자선 ⟪k:4⟫옮기기도 "
"힘들었습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_B209F362_E56D_4702_B665_2D9FEC5833CE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6faa1b9b651b875adfcba90ac147d32030fa9885349ad8cbb3db18a4984cda4a
